        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Pained Muttering"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, aura, emotion, fear)\n\n10 feet. The trailgaunt's constant mutters and groans of pain are deeply unsettling. Each creature that starts its turn in the aura must succeed at a 20 Fortitude save or become frightened 1 (frightened 2 on a critical failure). The creature is then temporarily immune for 1 minute."
            },
